--- !u!114 &1906070766
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1906070765}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3093990bcc5ff174698bfe14855cf569, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Character: {fileID: 88538690}
  m_FreeRoam: 0
  m_PerspectiveSelection: {fileID: 950230356}
  m_TextPanel: {fileID: 412137216}
  m_Header: {fileID: 1922965115}
  m_Description: {fileID: 1692105214}
  m_Action: {fileID: 1891251597}
  m_NextZoneArrow: {fileID: 413308004}
  m_PreviousZoneArrow: {fileID: 1633252528}
  m_QuitButton: {fileID: 0}
  m_DemoZones:
  - m_Header: Welcome
    m_Description: 'The {AssetName} is a professional, kinematic character controller
      designed to include the smoothest controls and to excel in all areas: PC, mobile,
      console, AI, networking, and VR.'
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 996434787}
    m_EnableObjects:
    - {fileID: 1906070769}
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: About
    m_Description: In 2016 we acquired UFPS, the most popular FPS asset on the Asset
      Store. We then started with an empty project taking the best parts of UFPS
      and our existing character controller, the Third Person Controller. Our result
      is called the Ultimate Character Controller and we hope you enjoy it.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 871493578}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: About
    m_Description: 'This demo will walk you through some of its core features. Get
      started by picking up a weapon. '
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1970601583}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Movement
    m_Description: The core controller features a cool, tweakable motor and determinstic
      kinematic physics simulation. This allows for ultra smooth movement with infinite
      movement possibilities.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1095421919}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Movement Types
    m_Description: 'The character and camera can change the way they interpret input.



      -
      Press Escape to switch between the movement types.

      - Press Enter to
      switch movement types after leaving this zone.'
    m_Action: PRESS ESCAPE TO SWITCH MOVEMENT TYPES
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1271453905}
    m_EnableObjects:
    - {fileID: 1906070768}
    - {fileID: 490345480}
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Shootable
    m_Description: Shootable weapons allow your character to damage their enemy with
      hitscan or projectile bullets. The same scripts can be used for weapons such
      as a bow and arrow or dual wield pistols.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1466887991}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects:
    - {fileID: 1131491845}
  - m_Header: Melee
    m_Description: Melee weapons give your character the ability to attack short
      range targets. The melee weapon system is flexible allowing for a variety of
      melee weapon types, including a two handed sword attack or punching and kicking.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1629992567}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Magic
    m_Description: Magic items are a versitile type of action that allow your character
      to cast spells. Different spell varieties can be created by combining magic
      sub-actions on the item. This system allows for an infinite number of spell
      varients.
    m_Action: PRESS ESCAPE TO SELECT MAGIC ITEMS
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 157156694}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Dynamic Gravity
    m_Description: This is where it gets really fun. The character controller allows
      for gravity directional changes giving your character the flexibility to walk
      around a planet.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 252184137}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: First Person Springs
    m_Description: "The spring system allows for ultra smooth procedural animation
      of player movements. Camera and items are manipulated with hundreds of parameters,
      allowing for a vast range of behaviors. \n"
    m_Action: PRESS ESCAPE TO SWITCH BETWEEN PRESETS
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 27269613}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects:
    - {fileID: 1131491845}
  - m_Header: Mouse Smoothing
    m_Description: 'Any good character controller should offer input smoothing and
      acceleration.

      - Smoothing interpolates mouse input over several frames
      to reduce jitter.

      - Acceleration + low mouse sensitivity allows high
      precision movement without loss of turn speed.'
    m_Action: PRESS ESCAPE TO COMPARE SMOOTHING TYPES
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 2091613121}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Mirrors
    m_Description: Mirrors can show a reflection in either a first or third person
      perspective.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 152065600}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Editor Scripts
    m_Description: Extensive editor scripts have been created to allow you to build
      new characters and items in seconds. No more messing around with ensuring all
      of the correct components have been added.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 964736042}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects:
    - {fileID: 392663466}
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Interact
    m_Description: An extremely extensible ability system is included allowing for
      new functionality without having to change the core character controller code.
      In this room the Interact ability allows the character to open a door, open
      a treasure chest, or press a button.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1554864721}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects:
    - {fileID: 1546677349}
    - {fileID: 1674857584}
    - {fileID: 838814856}
    - {fileID: 1719191616}
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Surface System
    m_Description: The Surface System is responsible for spawning effects caused
      by collisions and impacts. It is designed to be dynamic, powerful, and useful
      in a broad range of possible physics situations.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1761667110}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Effects
    m_Description: The Effects System allows the character to play localized effects
      such as a camera shake or boss stomp. Step on the pad to play each effect.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 123808450}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects:
    - {fileID: 1131491845}
  - m_Header: Death
    m_Description: The Die and Ragdoll abilities allow for death effects through
      dynamic ragdoll physics or a precreated death animation.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 664751016}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects:
    - {fileID: 1131491845}
  - m_Header: Aiming
    m_Description: Never lose your target again with the target lock component. Headshots
      can also be used which will kill your target instantly.
    m_Action: AIM TO LOCK ON TO A TARGET
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 774076269}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects:
    - {fileID: 1877037587}
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Virtual Controls
    m_Description: 'The Ultimate Character Controller is extremely well optimized
      and designed to run on mobile devices. Mobile controls are included within
      the asset, or you can use a dedicated mobile input asset.

      (The displayed
      virtual controls are not active.)'
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 508478996}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects:
    - {fileID: 656736974}
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: States
    m_Description: The Ultimate Character Controller components use an extremely
      useful state system which allows you to easily change the component values
      at runtime using a set of presets. Most of this demo was created using the
      state system.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 295957231}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects:
    - {fileID: 1322986051}
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: 2.5D
    m_Description: The 2.5D mode allows your character to move with a 2.5D camera.
      Any functionality that can be performed in a first or third person perspective
      can also be performed in a 2.5D perspective.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 648501504}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Top Down
    m_Description: Top Down characters will move with the camera overhead. The Object
      Fader component will optionally fade any objects that would otherwise obstruct
      the view the character.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 948771005}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Point Click
    m_Description: Point & Click will use pathfinding to the move the character to
      the position clicked on by the cursor or finger.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 501076930}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Planet Transfer
    m_Description: Gravity Zones allow planets to exert different gravity forces.
      Try jumping from the small planet to the large planet.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1174643762}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Generic
    m_Description: The Ultimate Character Controller isn't limited to just humanoids
      - generic characters are also supported! The horse is controlled by the Ultimate
      Character Controller. Go ahead - hop on for a ride!
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1131491846}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Flashlight
    m_Description: The flashlight is a small item allowing a light to switch on or
      off when the item is used. Pickup a flashlight to turn off the lights in the
      cave. The orange bar on the top left represents the flashlight battery.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 2000808457}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Drive
    m_Description: The Drive ability works with vehicle controllers and allows your
      character to drive any type of vehicle. The ability was created with extensibility
      in mind enabling integration with other vehicle controllers.
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1476805662}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  - m_Header: Free Roam
    m_Description: The major features have been covered but there is so much more
      - IK, throwing weapons, moving platforms, AI ready, the list goes on and on.
      We hope you enjoy the Ultimate Character Controller - let us know what you
      are working on by joining our forums or submitting your game to our showcase
      page!
    m_Action: 
    m_DemoZoneTrigger: {fileID: 1596339502}
    m_EnableObjects: []
    m_ToggleObjects: []
    m_InverseToggleObjects: []
  m_FreeRoamPickupItemDefinitions: 1
  m_FreeRoamItemDefinitionAmounts:
  - ItemDefinition: {fileID: 114334400771614146, guid: 5481010ef14c32f4cb7b6661b0c59fb4,
      type: 2}
